<title>POLAND: POLISH IZOLACJA INSULATION FIRM IPO OVERSUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>POLISH IZOLACJA INSULATION FIRM IPO OVERSUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors subscribed for 110,779 of 100,130 shares offered in Polish insulation materials firm Izolacja SA's initial public offering earlier in the month, the firm said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said orders were reduced by 9.6 percent.</p>
<p>The issue price was 120 zlotys.</p>
<p>Izolacja, which plans to enter the Warsaw bourse's main market, would be the first firm from Poland's mass privatisation National Investment Fund (NFI) scheme to gain a bourse listing.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
